            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+type+theory"} dependent type theory
            can be defined using inference rules without propositional truncations.)
          %h3#using_hubs_and_spokes Using hubs and spokes
          %p
            In section 7.3 of the
